{"id":"tratado","lemma":"tratado","pos":"noun","rank":2219,"glosses":["treaty (binding agreement under international law)","treatise (systematic discourse on some subject)"],"ipa":"/tɾaˈta.du/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"tratados"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Wiktionairy-tratado.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eu quero ser tratado com respeito.","en":"I want to be treated with respect.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"respect"}]},{"text":"Temos problemas que precisam ser tratados","en":"We have problems that need to be dealt with.","words":[{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},{"g":"problem","l":"problema"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to need","l":"precisar"},{"g":"to be"},null]},{"text":"Eu teria te tratado melhor.","en":"I would've treated you better.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"desirable","l":"bom"}]},{"text":"Ele foi tratado de forma terrível.","en":"He was treated terribly.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"form"},{"g":"terrible"}]},{"text":"Estou cansado de ser tratado assim.","en":"I'm tired of being treated this way.","words":[{"g":"am","l":"estar"},{"g":"sleepy, tired"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"this way"}]}]}